{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年66歲的何家勁昔日憑藉電視劇《包青天》飾演「展昭」一角爆紅，帥氣外型深入民心，更有「最帥展昭」的稱號。</p><p>近日他在直播時奉勸粉絲千萬不要盲目移民，坦言不少人離鄉別井後都相當後悔，而他也在鏡頭前罕見回應秘婚生女的話題。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T20:27:49.794044+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T20:01:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T20:20:39.942099+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T20:20:39.942099+00:00","content_hash":"20b507984778940150bc4ec6a0b7517ca8d96962e1e7452fefa97d0749df023e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}